License. rust/crates/manytype_proto/LICENSE describes those files, and
rust/crates/manytype_proto/licenses holds the upstream notices. The vendored
cargokit/ directory keeps its own LICENSE.

anytype_flutter also depends on anytype and, through it, on
manytype_protocol, whose Dart types generated from Anytype-heart schemas
carry the same ASAL 1.0 terms. ASAL permits use only for Non-Commercial Use or
for Commercial Use in Allowed Networks. See the manytype_protocol LICENSE
before distributing or deploying software built on this package.

